    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Grimes Clontarf are delighted to bring this bright and spacious ground floor apartment to the market. Apartment 2 Court View is a 1 bedroom apartment located in this sought after location on Castle Avenue in Clontarf.  \r\n\r\nNo. 2 provides approx. 32 sq m /  344 sq ft of light-filled and comfortable living and bedroom accommodation. This bright and spacious apartment comprises in brief of a double bedroom, bathroom, kitchen and living / dining area. \r\n \r\nSituated in Clontarf, a mature and settled area, the location is second to none. This fine apartment is close to a host of local amenities including the Clontarf Promenade and cycle track, and the popular St. Anne's Park. There is a quality bus corridor which operates along the Clontarf Road providing an efficient link to the City Centre and the 130 bus stop is located nearby. In addition to this, there are an abundance of schools, shops and restaurants on your doorstep, all within walking distance."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Bathroom: \r\nWith wash hand basin, WC and walk-in rain head shower \r\n\r\nBedroom: \r\nSpacious double room with built-in wardrobe \r\n\r\nKitchen: \r\nFitted with an array of modern wall and floor units  \r\n\r\nLiving / Dining Room: \r\nWith ample living / dining space with laminate flooring and storage presses with washing machine. Patio door to rear  \r\n\r\nServices: \r\nCommunal Parking\r\nGas Heating System\r\n\r\nManagement Company: \r\nCourt View Management Company \r\n\r\nManagement Fee: \r\nApprox. €1,000 per annum (subject to change)   \r\n\r\nBER Details:\r\nBER: C1 \r\nBER No: 104639232 \r\nEnergy Performance Indicator: 172.68 kWh/m²/yr \r\n\r\nContents Included:\r\nFixtures and Fittings \r\nWhite goods - Washing machine and microwave"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Bright and spacious ground floor 1 bed apartment \r\nApprox. 32 sq m / 344 sq ft \r\nPlentiful communal parking \r\nExcellent and sought-after location"
      },
